The article does not criticize a person or institution, allege wrongdoing, or report a dispute requiring a response opportunity. No needless harm, stereotyping, or commercial influence is detected. Reported analysis is distinct from advocacy throughout.

**Failure layer diagnosis**

The assignment, sources, and instructions were sufficient to produce a publishable manuscript. The body prose demonstrates this. The description and summary failures are execution errors against explicit form requirements stated in the prompt; the context-usage issue in the final section is an execution error against an explicit sourcing rule. Both are writer-model failures, not upstream defects in assignment or sources. A targeted replay of the three identified repairs produces a publishable manuscript without any structural changes to the body.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;H850Ydb5Bn0yhBfFqL-1yB7Qg9CltQUtMDY7sA_-v0Eƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Qz0qA8PGvGCrXN0fJ38DAghSY8yhJQLm_yEwZl4vNEMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky„Description field must include the analytical frame. Current text ('Spain face Argentina in the FIFA World Cup final this Sunday at MetLife Stadium in New Jersey.') is a bare event statement (~80 characters) with no hook. Per the form exemplar, the description targets approximately 113 characters and must convey the article's geometry/space-control angle so a reader knows why to click.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;oehS7y10maU-bj2iiHvPhjFlz5qE5ll9_DFOjLszsrAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkySummary field must be trimmed to approximately 53 words across three sentences (the event, the key numbers or development, the frame). The current summary runs approximately 84 wordsâ€”nearly double the targetâ€”and must be compressed without losing the geometry thesis.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;3hw7Scm941FUZM0G6UL65nRtP_Cdc5V8M86PCOpgAxgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky½The 'W